**Arethian** (/' *ari:θiən* /, [[arethian|Arethian]]: *Αρεθιαν*) is the language spoken in the areas of [[naanuath-empire|Naanuath Empire]], [[vianis-river-delta|Vianis River Delta]], [[the-rift|The Rift]] and [[praetia|Praetia]].
