# Grammar

## Nouns
&nbsp| Singular | Plural
--|--|--
Definite|No affix<br>**thib θιβ** /θib/<br>*the dog*|Prefix **oː**-<br>**oothib οːθιβ** /ˈoːθib/<br>*the dogs*
Indefinite|Prefix **ta**-<br>**tathib ταθιβ** /ˈtaθib/<br>*a dog*|If starts with vowel: Prefix **t**-<br>Else: Prefix **te**-<br>**tethib τεθιβ** /ˈteθib/<br>*some dogs*

## Articles
Arethian encodes definite article ‘the’, and indefinite article ‘a’ in noun affixes. See Noun section.

