## Derivational Morphology
 | | 
--|--|--
**Adjective → adverb**|If ends with vowel: Suffix -dmaː<br>Else: Suffix -odmaː|δμα<br>οδμα
**Adjective → noun (the quality of being [adj])**|Suffix -a|α
**Adjective → verb (to make something [adj])**|Prefix doː-|δο
**Noun → adjective (having the quality of [noun])**|Prefix baː-|βα
**Noun → adjective relating to noun (e.g. economy → economic)**|If ends with vowel: Suffix -z<br>Else: Suffix -yz|ζ<br>υζ 
**Noun to verb** | If starts with vowel: Prefix p-<br>Else: Prefix pɔɪ̯-|π<br>πϙ
**Verb → adjective (result of doing [verb])**| If ends with vowel: Suffix -f<br>Else: Suffix -yf|φ<br>υφ
**Tending to**|If starts with vowel: Prefix b-<br>Else: Prefix bo-|β<br>βο  
**Verb → noun (the act of [verb])**|If ends with vowel: Suffix -k<br>Else: Suffix -ak|κ<br>ακ 
**Verb → noun that verb produces (e.g. know → knowledge)**|Suffix -a:k|ακ
**One who [verb]s (e.g. paint → painter)**|If ends with vowel: Suffix -k<br>Else: Suffix -yːk|κ<br>υκ 
**Place of (e.g. wine → winery)**|If ends with vowel: Suffix -k<br>Else: Suffix -ek|κ<br>εκ 
**Diminutive**|If ends with vowel: Suffix -rxeː<br>Else: Suffix -aːrxeː|ρχε<br>αρχε 
**Augmentative**|If ends with vowel: Suffix -ks<br>Else: Suffix -aks|ξ<br>αξ

### Suffixes
 | | 
--|--|--
**Noun → Rights (e.g., city → city rights)** | Suffix **-ath** | αθ  
**Noun → Person associated with (e.g., citizen)** | Suffix **-or** | ορ  
**Noun → Status or condition (e.g., citizenship)** | Suffix **-ari** | αρι  
**Noun → Act or ceremony (e.g., issuance)** | Suffix **-ion** | ιον  
**Noun → Leader or head (e.g., stadholder)** | Suffix **-hold** | χολδ  
**Noun → Collective activities or business** | Suffix **-ion** | ιον  
**Verb → Act of doing (e.g., minting coins)** | Suffix **-ari** | αρι  
**Noun → Master or overseer (e.g., mintmaster)** | Suffix **-or** | ορ

